{"v":4,"catch":"打倒壞人，為你的功夫大師報仇！","desc":"《SHAO-LIN'S ROAD》是KONAMI於1985年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制被關在Jaken寺的金式少林武術學生WANPYOU，這是刺殺WANPYOU的師父RAOCHUU的邪惡YAMUCHA幫派的基地。用你的閃電-快速踢球，為自由和勝利而戰！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-11-09","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ade0b3cbde86fd429bbe13609c6a6e03258daf5e39eab38ca103fbb834530fcf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f7d8949b6cbab2bdc8b42161cfaeaf2ac03038fd7790ac498d539a8f9d0a1be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/813ca61d92b52e44ae32421aeae179579df2155bed678acae54a73d3a7d45f2e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0d69734100ee34311de51faf79b94d2b00732719c0c97a359ff1024d499c2cb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f36c9e0159a8413e7e1e6271dc07a9c9cde2a7f7477b6f024fd0c6a184c7fc9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0dc306739f8e10a93ff0953db5c2c2809b1acab6d220cf6883b1d31dfe612fb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f0e01cadc000","dlc":[]}